{"ticker":"SBAC","updated":"2026-10-23T23:59:49Z","profile":{"longName":"SBA Communications Corporation","shortName":"SBA Communications Corporation","sector":"Real Estate","industry":"REIT - Specialty","country":"United States","website":"https://www.sbasite.com","fullTimeEmployees":1844,"marketCap":19599777792,"trailingPE":19.92988,"forwardPE":22.907343,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":6.827711,"pegRatio":10.77,"targetMeanPrice":225.25,"targetHighPrice":280.0,"targetLowPrice":164.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":20,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.023,"earningsGrowth":-0.105,"grossMargins":0.742,"operatingMargins":0.52165,"profitMargins":0.34512,"totalRevenue":2870621952,"beta":0.994,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":224.46,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":156.6,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.8},"summary":"SBA Communications Corporation is a leading independent owner and operator of wireless communications infrastructure, including tower structures, rooftops and other structures that support antennas used for wireless communications. In our site leasing business, we lease space to wireless service providers and other customers on assets we own or operate, and manage rooftop and tower sites for property owners under various contractual arrangements. As of December 31, 2025, we owned 46,328 towers, a substantial portion of which were built by us or by other tower owners or operators who, like us, build towers to lease space to multiple wireless service providers. As of December 31, 2025, each of our towers had an average of 1.8 tenants. SBA Communications Corporation was established in 1989 and was incorporated in Florida.","summary_zh":"SBA Communications Corporation 是無線通訊基礎設施的領先獨立所有者和營運商，包括塔式結構、屋頂和其他支援無線通訊天線的結構。在我們的場地租賃業務中，我們向無線服務提供者和其他客戶租賃我們擁有或經營的資產的空間，並根據各種合約安排為業主管理屋頂和塔樓場地。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我們擁有 46,328 座塔，其中很大一部分是由我們或其他塔所有者或運營商建造的，這些塔所有者或運營商像我們一樣建造塔以向多個無線服務提供商租賃空間。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我們的每棟大樓平均有 1.8 位租戶。 SBA Communications Corporation 成立於 1989 年